  "problemStatement": {
    "formal": "x^{(k)} \\;=\\; \\prod_{i=0}^{k-1} (x + i) \\;=\\; x\\,(x+1)\\cdots(x+k-1),\n\\qquad x^{(0)} = 1 .",
    "plain": "The ordinary binomial theorem expands $(x+y)^r$ into a sum of $\\binom{r}{j} x^j y^{r-j}$.",
